  "prefLabel": "Per 102.70 Per diem",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.70 “Per diem” means a worker who is employed on an as-needed basis, typically working intermittently or occasionally, and is paid a daily or hourly rate.\n\nSource. #14434, eff 12-1-25",
